This skill is a standalone adaptation of the `deep-thinking` skill from the
`think-through` Claude Code plugin. The only substantive change is that Stage 2
dispatches `general-purpose` agents with the expert framework inlined, instead of
the plugin's `think-through:expert` sub-agent, so it runs without a plugin
dependency. Original logic, expert table, and document format are unchanged.

